    <!--
        Restored per D4 rollback (tasks/antennapod-fix-spotbugs-static-analysis-debt.md), then
        narrowed to method scope per red-team Loop 1 (Implementation): removing the original
        class-wide entry surfaced a real, pre-existing, previously-masked finding unrelated to this
